AffordabilityFallback; AffordabilityFallback is used by AgentController; ScenarioDrafts is used by AgentController; PlainText is used by
AgentController.
Old classes show only the members that were in Stage 1 and still exist; members that are unchanged are not repeated. Every changed or new class
(orange / green) lists its current members in its box.
bg=#E6F2FF</panel_attributes><additional_attributes /></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>0</x><y>1294</y><w>1000</w><h>48</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>STAGE 2 LEGEND: orange = changed from Stage 1 (renamed, new signature or fields, handlers/private fields dropped); green = new in Stage 2, placed next
to the class that uses it (dashed arrow = uses; hollow-triangle line = inheritance/implements; "used by" lists every user). Unmarked = unchanged.
bg=#FFF2A8</panel_attributes><additional_attributes /></element></diagram>